# Heap Data Structure & Heap Sort Algorithm

## Self-Study Project for COMP2090SEF - Task 2

---

## 1. Project Overview

This project implements two computer science concepts not covered in the course:

| Concept | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| **Heap** | A special complete binary tree data structure (Min Heap & Max Heap) |
| **Heap Sort** | A comparison-based sorting algorithm using heap data structure |

---

## 2. Files Description

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `heap.py` | Implementation of MinHeap and MaxHeap classes |
| `heap_sort.py` | Implementation of heap sort algorithm |
| `main.py` | Demonstration program with test cases |
| `README.md` | This user guide |

---

## 3. Requirements

- **Python Version**: Python 3.7 or higher
- **External Libraries**: None (uses only Python standard library)

